@startuml
title AI Delivery Assistant - Activity Diagram

skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 8

skinparam activity {
    BackgroundColor #F4F8FC
    BorderColor #315B7D
    FontColor #0F172A
    ArrowColor #315B7D
}

skinparam diamond {
    BackgroundColor #F1F5F9
    BorderColor #315B7D
    FontColor #0F172A
}

|User (Customer / Merchant / Courier / Admin)|
start
:User enters natural language query;

|AI Assistant Service|
:Attach active session context & user role metadata;
:Submit prompt + tool definitions to LLM;

|LLM Engine|
:Analyze user intent & query parameters;

if (Tool invocation required?) then (yes)
    :Return Tool Call request with arguments;

    |Core Delivery APIs / MCP Tools|
    if (Requested action) then (Track Parcel)
        :Query Parcel Service for tracking history & ETA;
    else if (Estimate Fee)
        :Calculate shipping rate from weight & zones;
    else if (Merchant Orders)
        :Fetch merchant parcel list and states;
    else if (Courier Runs)
        :Fetch courier daily assigned deliveries;
    else (Admin / Dispatcher Analytics)
        :Fetch system workloads & delivery metrics;
    endif
    :Return JSON data payload to AI Service;

    |LLM Engine|
    :Synthesize natural language response using fetched data;
else (general policy / FAQ query)
    :Formulate direct contextual reply;
endif

|AI Assistant Service|
:Append response to conversation history;

|User (Customer / Merchant / Courier / Admin)|
:Display formatted response & interactive status cards;
stop

@enduml
